+      "positive": ["Author runtime/compiler and PD workload scripts are public; existing LLVM18/SM89 mapped-host port can execute selected rewritten kernels."],
+      "boundaries": ["PD scripts call modified LLMEngine.get_prefill_result/wait_prefill_shutdown and enable VLLM_PREFILL_THREAD; author environment records local source vLLM0.1.dev24+g232ce74 and Torch2.6.0a0. The complete public tree does not bundle that modified vLLM/PyTorch tree; current installed stock vLLM has no matching API occurrences.", "NInfer's existing single worker/prefill-lane executor does not become concurrent author PD scheduling merely through LD_PRELOAD.", "Prior mapped-host port remains numerically unqualified for GDN cooperative launch/GQA; targeted corrections and actual probes are required."],
+      "decision": "Prioritize actual launch-semantics/numerical qualification. Do not report a kernel-only hook as complete MorphXPD or infer performance from compatibility failure."
+    },
