+      "name": "BulletServe",
+      "commit": "c4aa493b737c861128e6a5b6b0b3413cb26aed63",
+      "status": "native_hybrid_path_absent; fallback_and_state_contract_need_bounded_probe",
+      "positive": ["P/D weights use CUDA IPC sharing via init_rpc_model_weight; claiming two full weight copies would be incorrect.", "Public P/D scheduler, SM control and request/KV RPC exist."],
+      "boundaries": ["Complete tree has Qwen3 attention-only models but no Qwen3_5 native class. Registry can select TransformersForCausalLM fallback, so missing native class alone is not proof the whole model is rejected.", "Generic fallback states one attention operation per hidden layer; RPC pool types transfer request tables and MHA K/V, without a GDN/SSM recurrent-state handoff in the inspected code. Existing hybrid-cache branch is Llama4 local/full attention rather than GDN.", "Author prerequisites include MPS and libsmctrl/CUDA<=12.6; do not invoke stock scripts defaulting to GPU0."],
+      "decision": "Bounded actual CPU contract/fallback inspection before installing another stack; do not fake Qwen3_5 with attention-only Qwen3 or claim model-level OOM from duplicated weights."
+    },
